  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for support of digital and in-person educational programs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ana Polanco Consulting provides social change organizations, networks, and communities that are culturally centered and globally rooted with the skills, encouragement, and compassion to pursue their wildest dreams. The organization approaches this vision by developing and expanding decolonized approaches to the well-being of individuals and institutions that want to center their purpose and redefine collective freedom. This grant will enable Ana Polanco Consulting to invest in its educational programs through a digital learning course and in-person retreats for social change organizations, networks, and communities in need. (Gender Equity and Governance)</narrative>
  </description>
